1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,812
You'd never expect lines of holes on the seafloor.

2
00:00:02,832 --> 00:00:06,414
But in 2022, NOAA found several sets,

3
00:00:06,434 --> 00:00:09,792
2,540 meters deep. What made them, actually?

4
00:00:09,812 --> 00:00:11,650
NOAA said they look almost human made.

5
00:00:11,670 --> 00:00:13,834
But little piles of sediment around them

6
00:00:13,854 --> 00:00:15,728
suggest something dug them out.

7
00:00:15,748 --> 00:00:18,698
Sediment from fresher holes gave no clues.

8
00:00:18,718 --> 00:00:21,606
Similar holes were seen back in 2004.

9
00:00:21,626 --> 00:00:22,771
Still unknown.

10
00:00:22,791 --> 00:00:25,436
Five more deep sea mysteries are on the channel.
